# Strength of Will: "Whenever this creature is dealt damage, put that many +1/+1 counters on it." Damage dealt at once by several
# sources is one event, so the ability triggers once for the total (CR 510.2, 603.2c; Boros Reckoner's ruling). Bot1's Grizzly
# Bears, given it on turn 3, attacks and is blocked by Bot2's two Memnites: they deal it 1 each at once, one trigger for 2, and
# Hardened Scales adds one to that single placement - 3 counters, a 5/5. Had each Memnite's damage triggered on its own, Hardened
# Scales would have added one to each - 4 counters.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Black Lotus
Hardened Scales
Grizzly Bears
Strength of Will
Forest
Forest x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Memnite
Island x18

